Package: tcxflow
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: lightweight eBPF-based IPFIX flow accounting
 tcxflow meters the traffic of selected network interfaces with a small eBPF
 program on the kernel's tcx hook and exports the flows as IPFIX (RFC 7011)
 to one or more collectors.
 .
 It replaces ipt_NETFLOW on modern systems: no out-of-tree kernel module, no
 iptables or nftables rules, and it works on routers whose interfaces live in
 a separate network namespace.
